@meganrogge Had to revert to unblock our insiders build

From @deepak1556 in Slack
The foundry node addon added in https://github.com/microsoft/vscode/pull/326678 breaks our minimum supported distros, it requires GLIBC 2.34 which requires us to drop Ubuntun 20, Debian 10 and RHEL 8 client support. The onxx runtime itself has satisfying deps, its just the addon.
